WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.210
My next guest became a viral sensation on TikTok

2
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:05.790
for breaking into someone's home.

3
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.550
But it's not what you're thinking.

4
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.650
'Cause we're not advocating that here.

5
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.180
He didn't actually take anything from the house,

6
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.740
not even a little,

7
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.350
but he did leave it spotless after spending

8
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.530
two and a half hours cleaning it from top to bottom.

9
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:23.095
Yeah, I know this is such a wild story. Check this out.

10
00:00:23.095 --> 00:00:24.020
(upbeat guitar music)

11
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:27.460
So my friend tells me that one of his coworkers

12
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.410
wants me to clean his apartment.

13
00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.710
So I go there today and he tells me that there's a key

14
00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.910
under the mat, get the key, go into the apartment,

15
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:40.827
clean the entire apartment. So he calls me and he's like,

16
00:00:40.827 --> 00:00:42.060
"Yo, where are you?"

17
00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:42.893
And I was like,

18
00:00:42.893 --> 00:00:45.730
"Um... I'm in your living room, waiting for you to walk in.

19
00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:47.730
I'm playing with your cat."

20
00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:52.090
He goes, "Uh, man, I don't have a cat."

21
00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:52.923
What?!

22
00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:57.940
So comes to find out that I cleaned the wrong apartment,

23
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:01.850
and broke in and clean somebody's random apartment.

24
00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.299
You're welcome?

25
00:01:03.299 --> 00:01:04.870
(crowd laughs)

26
00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.855
Please say hello to Louis Angelino!

27
00:01:06.855 --> 00:01:09.438
(crowd cheers)

28
00:01:12.407 --> 00:01:13.910
So, how did this happen?

29
00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:15.650
So, I was off by one digit.

30
00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:20.513
It was only one number. 227 instead of 277.

31
00:01:21.806 --> 00:01:23.960
And I had just assumed

32
00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.653
that I was going to the right address,

33
00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:31.270
but it just so happened that there was two keys

34
00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.890
under both of the mats,

35
00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.900
which is insane, because what are the odds

36
00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.320 line:15%
that there's going to be two keys on the same time

37
00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.303 line:15%
in the same day, under both mats?

38
00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:45.320
How did you even get into the taking care

39
00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:46.543
of people's homes?

40
00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:48.550
To be completely honest,

41
00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.650
with everything that happened with COVID,

42
00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.390
I was feeling very, like, uninspired,

43
00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:57.080
and she's in the audience right now,

44
00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.920
my best friend, Joe Durand's mom,

45
00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.476
and my mother are in the office.

46
00:02:00.476 --> 00:02:03.983
Oh, hi!
(crowd claps)

47
00:02:03.983 --> 00:02:07.230
That is them. They are the ones that...

48
00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.407
My mom, ever since I was a kid has always told me,

49
00:02:10.407 --> 00:02:12.950
"Clean room, clean mind."

50
00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:16.184
And Diana, who looks so lovely today,

51
00:02:16.184 --> 00:02:17.850
(crowd awws)

52
00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:20.880
told me she came up with the idea

53
00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:24.280
to pay me like 50 bucks a week

54
00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.399
to just to keep the apartment clean

55
00:02:26.399 --> 00:02:29.180
for her and my best friend.

56
00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.590 line:15%
And it started out with that, and through doing that,

57
00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.390 line:15%
I would just, you know, I would go in there

58
00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.400 line:15%
with my Bluetooth speaker, and I'm jamming out,

59
00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.650
and I'm dancing, and I'm swiffering,

60
00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:41.350
and I'm having so much fun,

61
00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:43.160
and I don't even realize that I'm cleaning.

62
00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:46.300
I was at a very dark place at that time,

63
00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.610
I didn't have a car. I didn't have a job.

64
00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:52.510
I really didn't have a purpose, and they gave me that.

65
00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:57.020
Thank you guys so much for giving that type of advice

66
00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:01.850
and direction, and being such positive influences.

67
00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:04.610
And I want to celebrate things like this in the world,

68
00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:07.190
and, you know, you have this new passion

69
00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:09.490
and you're going to pursue this as a career?

70
00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:12.620
I would love to. That would be the dream.

71
00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:15.040
All right. Well, I know that you started a GoFundMe page

72
00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.290
to help kickstart your cleaning career,

73
00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.970
and your giving, and your altruism,

74
00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.490
and you're taking care of people,

75
00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:25.040
and we just want to help you continue that and foster that.

76
00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.807
So our friends at Safely are giving you

77
00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:32.807
$10,000 worth of Safely cleaning products.

78
00:03:33.148 --> 00:03:35.480
(crowd cheers)
Oh, my God!

79
00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.440
And that is not only a year's worth of supplies,

80
00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:41.030
but we'd love to feature you on our website

81
00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.522
and help build your business.

82
00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:45.233
(crowd cheers)
Oh, my God!

83
00:03:47.232 --> 00:03:49.630
Thank you, yes.
Where do I sign?!

84
00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.370
Where do I sign my soul to you?

85
00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.481
You already did.

86
00:03:52.481 --> 00:03:54.930
Oh, girl. Oh, my God.
(crowd laughs)

87
00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:57.340
You already did.
Thank you so much.

88
00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.810
It's really a big thing for my mental health.

89
00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:02.050
And, like, that's one thing I wanted to mention,

90
00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.130
is that I know everybody somehow, someway,

91
00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:07.620
battles with something that goes on up here,

92
00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:11.330
and if something is keeping a clean environment

93
00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:15.140
can help somebody like me with mental health,

94
00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:18.650
it can help out somebody else too. And that's just,

95
00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.710
that's so important for me because mental health

96
00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:24.360
really, finally, I think we're at a point

97
00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.250
where it's being taken seriously.

98
00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.660
Yeah. I think athletes talking about it

99
00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.493
is really amazing.
Yes, yes.

100
00:04:29.493 --> 00:04:33.530
Because if they're saying they struggle,

101
00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:36.760
I think there's a lack of bias sometimes,

102
00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.410
or maybe a greater openness to understanding,

103
00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.920
that even the strongest people go through it.

104
00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.710 line:15%
But I think we also need to hear from everybody

105
00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.640 line:15%
about how important that mission is.

106
00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.080 line:15%
I mean, I see you building a whole business

107
00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.080 line:15%
that also recruits other people, like,

108
00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.250
let's get this going, Louis.

109
00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.170
Yeah. (laughs)
All right? Let's go.

110
00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.977
All right. Thank you, Louis.
(crowd cheers)

111
00:04:57.977 --> 00:05:01.230 line:15%
Go on TheDrewBarrymoreShow.com to learn more

112
00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.050 line:15%
